WEBVTT

00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:32.806
which was "One in every four times
a Kiwi eats a snack,

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.363
it will be one of ours."

00:00:35.266 --> 00:00:38.315
I emphasized that we knew
how to measure our results

00:00:38.339 --> 00:00:41.352
and that our future was in our control.

00:00:42.448 --> 00:00:43.655
Embarrassingly enough,

00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:46.392
I finished up with "If not this, what?

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:47.630
If not us, who?

00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:49.588
And if not now, when?"

00:00:51.231 --> 00:00:52.859
I got this huge round of applause

00:00:52.883 --> 00:00:55.950
and I was really,
really pleased with myself.

00:00:57.279 --> 00:00:59.746
I wanted so much to be a good leader.